Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:49:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Cover both fractions on either side of 1024, 2048 and
 4096 in the rounding test

On the previous rounding each of these came out off by a float step
(44.00006, 43.99994, 43.99988, 43.99988 and 43.99976); all are exactly 44
now.
